# Line endings
#
# Everything text is LF in the repository. This is here because the pack tooling
# generates and rewrites files from scripts, and a script that writes in text mode on
# Windows silently converts the whole file to CRLF — which turns a two-line change into
# a one-thousand-line diff and hides what actually changed. `text=auto` leaves detected
# binaries alone; the LevelDB files below are named anyway, because a compiled pack must
# never be touched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Compiled compendium packs are a LevelDB store, not source.
packs/*/*.ldb      binary
packs/*/*.log      binary
packs/*/CURRENT    binary
packs/*/MANIFEST-* binary
